Agents

    Agents can be defined in 2 ways:
    1. LLM that control the workflow
    2. An LLM agent runs tools in a loop to achieve a goal

    common features/characteristics:
    1. Memory/Persistence
    2. Planning capabilities
        To be able to plan activities
    3. Autonomy
        The sense of autonomy that LLM needs to make the decision on what happens next
    4. LLM orchestration via Tools
        The LLM to be able to orchestrate what happens next using tools
    5. Functionality via Tools

